      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After this unit is deployed in the reinforcment step, this unit can make a normal move.
If this unit has ‘Scouts x&quot;’, it can make an additonal move as if it was using the &apos;Scouts x&quot;&apos; ability aswell.</characteristic>
