      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Before making a battleshock test, for each model with this ability pick one **Skink** or **Kroxigor** unit within 12&quot;. That unit can choose to reroll one of the dice during the battleshock test.
This ability can&apos;t target the same unit more than once in the same battle round.</characteristic>
