    </profile>
    <profile name="Deadly Cohesion" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="078c-412e-80ec-959f">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your Fight Phase if this unit is not in engangment range of an enemy unit, pick a friendly **Raptadon Chargers** unit that charged this turn and is within 16&quot; of this unit to be the target. If the target unit is attacked by an enemy in the fight back part of your Fight Phase, this unit can make a ranged attack as if it were your shooting phase.
The same **Raptadon Chargers** unit can&apos;t be targeted by this ability more than once per Fight Phase.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
