    <profile name="Masters of Order " typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="a1eb-15d4-3783-9880">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Add 1 to hit rolls made with **Psychic** Weapons within 12&quot; of this unit, this ability doesn&apos;t affect this unit unless a different **Slann** unit is within 12&quot;. This ability can only be applied once per unit.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Arcane Vessel" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="29ef-3259-26d2-210d">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your command phase pick an allied **Psychic** unit without the **Slann** Keyword, that unit is now considered a vessel. Until your next command phase this units ranged attacks can be made from the position of that unit.
If this units vessel is destroyed, this unit takes 1D3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Celestial Reinforcements" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="e948-e63b-a143-f808">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In the declare battle formation step of battle pick one allied **Infantry** unit, in the reinforcment step of your movement phase that unit may be deployed as if it had **Deep Strike**.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
