      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your command phase pick a visible friendly **Seraphon** unit wholly within 18&quot; of this unit to be the target. Roll a D6, On a 2+ the target’s melee weapons have **Lethal Hits** until the start of your next command phase.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Wrath of The Saurus" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="8918-55ba-2521-d8e9">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Add 1 to wound rolls for attacks made by friendly **Saurus** **Infantry* units while they are  within 12&quot; of this unit.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Blessed Spawning" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="6b89-5fe6-ed3d-8b6f">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This unit and units attached to this unit can reroll save rolls of 1.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Celestial Conduit" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="39f1-8450-3806-baf3">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Add 1 to save rolls of friendly units with **Psyker** Keyword within 12&quot;, if there is an enemy **Psyker** unit within 12&quot; subtract 1 from their save rolls and add **Hazardous** to their **Psychic** Weapons if they have one.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Deadly Cargo" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="a872-5eb2-923b-142a">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time this unit ends a Normal move, you can select one enemy unit it moved over during that move and roll 2D6 for each model in this unit, for each 5+:
Inflict 1 mortal wound on the target, If any Wounds are allocated by this ability, the target cannot make an Advance or a Charge move in their next movement and charge phase.
This ability can&apos;t target units with the **Fly** Keyword.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
