      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this unit is destroyed, roll 3D6. If the combined roll + the amount of wounds this unit was dealt this turn is less than 19, revive this unit with the amount of wounds rolled. If the result is higher or equal to 19 this unit is destroyed.</characteristic>
