    <profile name="Adaptable" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="81a7-a597-eabb-8d48">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This unit can change its abilities based on its attached unit.


If its leading a **Chameleon Skinks** or **Hunters of Huanchi With Star-Venom Dartpipes** unit it gains **Stealth**, **Deep Strike** and its attached unit gains **Precision**.


If its leading a **Skink Cohort** or **Hunters of Huanchi With Starstone Bolas** it gains the **Warrior of Sotek** Ability.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Warrior of Sotek" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="af25-dc36-bc9c-7364">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This units attached unit gains +1 to its taughness and save characteristics.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Pack Herder" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="8592-7572-7293-2ba2">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This units attached unit gains +6&quot; of range on its ranged attacks.
If the attached unit is **Razordon Hunting Pack** it gains **Indirect Fire**, if the attached unit is **Salamander Hunting Pack** it gains **Sustained Hits 1**.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Sacred Blade of Quetzl " typeId="8a40-4aaa-c780-9046" typeName="Melee Weapons" hidden="false" id="e8cd-f1a8-4e01-f9f0">
      <characteristics>
