                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**COST**: 1 CP.


**WHEN**: Your Command Phase.


**TARGET**: Pick a friendly **Saurus** unit.


**EFFECT**: The target gains **Feel No Pian** 4+ against all non-**Psychic** attacks until your next command phase.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
