                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**COST**: 1 CP.


**WHEN**: Your Command Phase.


**TARGET**: Pick a friendly **Saurus** unit currently on an objective point.


**EFFECT**: Double the target Objective Control until the end of the phase.




**RESTRICTIONS**: The target can&apos;t move from the objective point until its next movement phase.</characteristic>
