                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**COST**: 1 CP.


**WHEN**: Opponents Charge Phase.


**TARGET**: Pick an enemy unit that finished a charge move in engangment range of any **Saurus** **Infantry** unit.


**EFFECT**: The target takes 1D3 mortal wound and additonal 1D3 mortal wound for every 3 models above 3 in that unit.

