                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**COST**: 2 CP.


**WHEN**: Your Fight Phase after the target unit gained a rage token.


**TARGET**: Any friendly **Beast** or **Monster** unit.


**EFFECT**: When this unit gains a rage token all **Beast** and **Monster** units within 12&quot; also gain one.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
