                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**COST**: 1 CP.


**WHEN**: Your Charge Phase.


**TARGET**: Pick a friendly **Seraphon** **Monster** unit.


**EFFECT**: This unit can charge at units up to 18&quot; away and now rolls 3D6 during a charge move until the end of the phase.</characteristic>
