                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**COST**: 1 CP.


**WHEN**: Your Shooting Phase.


**TARGET**: Pick a friendly **Monster** or **Beast** unit.


**EFFECT**: All ranged attacks made by this unit gain **Sustained Hits** 2 and +6&quot; of range until the end of the phase.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <constraints>
