                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**COST**: 1 CP.


**WHEN**: Any Phase.


**TARGET**: Pick a friendly **Seraphon** **Monster** or **Beast** unit.


**EFFECT**: Remove all rage tokens from the target and heal it 1D3 for each.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <constraints>
