        <selectionEntryGroup name="Seers of Tepok" id="a770-05ee-1096-414f" hidden="true" flatten="true">
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Banishment" hidden="false" id="e513-2e6e-ce82-a019">
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="0928-f0ee-9dfb-d1d2" includeChildSelections="false"/>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true" id="c024-eae7-5de1-07e1" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true"/>
              </constraints>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Banishment" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="c410-1e6d-762f-b34a">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**COST**: 3 CP.


**WHEN**: Any Command Phase.


**TARGET**: Pick an enemy unit that is Battle-Shocked within 12&quot; of a **Psyker** unit.


**EFFECT**: The target unit can&apos;t take any actions or be targeted by attacks or abilities from either player. From the second command phase on after the unit has been banished the unit makes a leadership test, if it succeds it is no longer banished abd can be selected as a target of attacks and abilities like normal.

</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Crusade Points" typeId="b03b-c239-15a5-da55" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Crusade: Battle Honours" typeId="75bb-ded1-c86d-bdf0" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Crusade: Experience" typeId="a623-fe74-1d33-cddf" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Crusade: Weapon Modifications" typeId="716d-91b7-d55a-1022" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Blackstone Fragments" typeId="ac6b-ced3-9b5e-9a6e" value="0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Comet of Cassadora" hidden="false" id="5a11-4087-4e3c-dea9">
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Comet of Cassadora" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="a876-ab7d-1e1c-1a5e">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**COST**: 4 CP.


**WHEN**: Your Shooting Phase.


**TARGET**: Pick a **Psyker** unit.


**EFFECT**: Instead of making a ranged attack this unit may use this ability. Pick a fixed point on the table within 16&quot; of the target. At the start of every Command Phase and innitialy when the ability is used, you roll 1D6. On a 1–4, roll 1D3 and add save the result for later. On a 5–6, the comet crashes down and every unit within 16&quot; of the target takes 2D6 Mortal Wounds + The amount rolled on the previously saved dice.

**RESTRICTIONS**: This ability can only be used once per battle.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="f77d-c637-4c5f-9eb3" includeChildSelections="false"/>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true" id="720d-b872-0300-c390" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true"/>
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Crusade Points" typeId="b03b-c239-15a5-da55" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Crusade: Battle Honours" typeId="75bb-ded1-c86d-bdf0" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Crusade: Experience" typeId="a623-fe74-1d33-cddf" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Crusade: Weapon Modifications" typeId="716d-91b7-d55a-1022" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Blackstone Fragments" typeId="ac6b-ced3-9b5e-9a6e" value="0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Extended Bandwidth" hidden="false" id="8160-4892-6f20-7f9f">
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Extended Bandwidth" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="73cb-ee5d-9dbb-833a">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**COST**: 1 CP.


**WHEN**: Your Command Phase.


**TARGET**: Pick a friendly **Psyker** unit.


**EFFECT**: This unit can benefit from the **Warp Conduit** ability even if a different unit is already benefiting from it unitl the end of the phase.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="c1a8-631e-9bdf-25f6" includeChildSelections="false"/>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true" id="cbc2-de0f-a195-8384" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true"/>
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Crusade Points" typeId="b03b-c239-15a5-da55" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Crusade: Battle Honours" typeId="75bb-ded1-c86d-bdf0" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Crusade: Experience" typeId="a623-fe74-1d33-cddf" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Crusade: Weapon Modifications" typeId="716d-91b7-d55a-1022" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Blackstone Fragments" typeId="ac6b-ced3-9b5e-9a6e" value="0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Great Concentration" hidden="false" id="72fc-7dd0-83ae-1724">
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Great Concentration" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="6ea5-58f3-b09d-6692">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**COST**: 1 CP.


**WHEN**: Your Shooting Phase or Fight Phase.


**TARGET**: Pick a friendly Channeling unit.


**EFFECT**: This unit can make an attakc while channeling.


**RESTRICTIONS**: This unit can&apos;t benefit from its own **Warp Conduit** Ability.

</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="cf19-74d6-0094-69c1" includeChildSelections="false"/>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true" id="f501-2529-2d50-599e" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true"/>
