        </selectionEntryGroup>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Spawns of Sotek" id="9d79-690d-4f63-35a2" hidden="true" flatten="true">
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Primal Cruelty" hidden="false" id="eced-b82c-b88e-76a8">
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="9302-6917-166d-9a1f" includeChildSelections="false"/>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true" id="f276-4bc4-2ce1-e1fc" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true"/>
              </constraints>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Primal Cruelty" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="5728-a0b4-840d-db1b">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**COST**: 1 CP.


**WHEN**: Your Charger Phase after this unit has charged.


**TARGET**: Pick a friendly **Kroxigor** unit in engangment range of an enemy unit to be the target.


**EFFECT**: Roll 1D6 for every model in this unit: on a 3-5, that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds; on a 6, that enemy unit suffers 3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Crusade Points" typeId="b03b-c239-15a5-da55" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Crusade: Battle Honours" typeId="75bb-ded1-c86d-bdf0" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Crusade: Experience" typeId="a623-fe74-1d33-cddf" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Crusade: Weapon Modifications" typeId="716d-91b7-d55a-1022" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Blackstone Fragments" typeId="ac6b-ced3-9b5e-9a6e" value="0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Ambush" hidden="false" id="e61e-679f-39ec-e045">
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Ambush" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="746d-cb0b-0430-aac6">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**COST**: 1 CP.


**WHEN**: Your Shooting Phase.


**TARGET**: Pick 2 friendly **Skink** unit with **Stealth** to be the target.


**EFFECT**: Add 1 to all hit rolls made by this unit unit the end of the phase. 


**RESTRICTIONS**: The target is 12&quot; or further from the enemy being attacked and at least 3&quot; from any other enemy units.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="17fa-f8b6-d513-f955" includeChildSelections="false"/>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true" id="20dd-b6f4-91af-547e" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true"/>
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Crusade Points" typeId="b03b-c239-15a5-da55" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Crusade: Battle Honours" typeId="75bb-ded1-c86d-bdf0" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Crusade: Experience" typeId="a623-fe74-1d33-cddf" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Crusade: Weapon Modifications" typeId="716d-91b7-d55a-1022" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Blackstone Fragments" typeId="ac6b-ced3-9b5e-9a6e" value="0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Establishing Dominance" hidden="false" id="497e-cbca-edec-5f5a">
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Establishing Dominance" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="33d1-036d-7f1c-2d0f">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**COST**: 1 CP.


**WHEN**: Your Fight Phase.


**TARGET**: Pick a friendly **Kroxigor** unit.


**EFFECT**: Each succesful wound applied by this model on to the enemy unit lowers its leadership score by 1.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="aacb-ea29-0f34-8b1b" includeChildSelections="false"/>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true" id="07d0-f3ab-a4d4-1126" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true"/>
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Crusade Points" typeId="b03b-c239-15a5-da55" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Crusade: Battle Honours" typeId="75bb-ded1-c86d-bdf0" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Crusade: Experience" typeId="a623-fe74-1d33-cddf" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Crusade: Weapon Modifications" typeId="716d-91b7-d55a-1022" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Blackstone Fragments" typeId="ac6b-ced3-9b5e-9a6e" value="0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Single Out" hidden="false" id="c3cd-d09c-d462-dc63">
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Single Out" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="3497-61fc-2775-3c50">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**COST**: 2 CP.


**WHEN**: Your Command Phase.


**TARGET**: Pick an enemy unit to be the target.


**EFFECT**: The enemy unit must make a normal move towards your nearest unit, if after the move its at least 8&quot; from any of its allies it must take a Battle-Shock test.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="043b-5da7-78aa-6e4a" includeChildSelections="false"/>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true" id="b281-60d1-34fc-4bf7" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true"/>
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Crusade Points" typeId="b03b-c239-15a5-da55" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Crusade: Battle Honours" typeId="75bb-ded1-c86d-bdf0" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Crusade: Experience" typeId="a623-fe74-1d33-cddf" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Crusade: Weapon Modifications" typeId="716d-91b7-d55a-1022" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Blackstone Fragments" typeId="ac6b-ced3-9b5e-9a6e" value="0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Offering to Sotek" hidden="false" id="cf6c-f405-96fa-5264">
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Offering to Sotek" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="d293-25ce-1918-5386">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**COST**: 3 CP.


**WHEN**: Your Command Phase


**TARGET**: Pick a friendly **Seraphon** **Infantry** unit.


**EFFECT**: At the end of your turn the target takes 8D3 Mortal Wounds, for every enemy model it killed this turn lower the amount of mortal wounds taken by 1D3. Until the end of this turn all your attacks have their attacks characteristic doubled, 2 to their AP and Damage characteristics as well as +4&quot; to their movement. If this unit fully destroys an enemy unit it may make a free move towards the nearest enemy.
**Mounted** models or fully destroying a unit counts as 2D6 each, **Monster** and **Vehicle** models count as 3D3 each while **Titanic** models count as 6D6.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="d01c-6055-8cff-0f24" includeChildSelections="false"/>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true" id="d071-700c-bb42-78e8" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true"/>
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Crusade Points" typeId="b03b-c239-15a5-da55" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Crusade: Battle Honours" typeId="75bb-ded1-c86d-bdf0" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Crusade: Experience" typeId="a623-fe74-1d33-cddf" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Crusade: Weapon Modifications" typeId="716d-91b7-d55a-1022" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Blackstone Fragments" typeId="ac6b-ced3-9b5e-9a6e" value="0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Prey on The Weak" hidden="false" id="f122-5623-eba6-05aa">
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Prey on The Weak" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="e2d6-0c5c-b0c5-8ec5">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**COST**: 1 CP.


**WHEN**: Your Movement Phase.


**TARGET**: Pick 2 friendly **Skink** **Infantry** unit.


**EFFECT**: When attacking a unit below half strength, this unit can reroll wound rolls of 1.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="dbda-2465-e734-7470" includeChildSelections="false"/>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true" id="762e-f5e7-1fab-0d0b" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true"/>
              </constraints>
              <costs>
